# Every env file, then re-include only the committed examples.
#
# Listing `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*.local` individually used to miss
# `.env.docker` — the exact file the README tells you to create and fill with
# secrets. `COPY . .` would have baked it into an image layer, where deleting it
# later does not remove it.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example

docs
README.md
PROJECT_PLAN.md
